WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-08 - Just Us
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.898
[Instrumental Intro — Warm Comforting Acoustic Guitar & Twinkling Piano]

00:00:14.898 --> 00:00:18.781
Close the door and lock the world outside

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:28.528
There's nowhere left that we need to hide

00:00:28.609 --> 00:00:34.653
The stage is empty and the lights are down

00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:39.517
We're the only two people left in this town

00:00:54.135 --> 00:00:58.477
The silence is loud but it feels so sweet

00:00:58.557 --> 00:01:01.918
No more running, no more defeat

00:01:01.978 --> 00:01:06.360
Just the sound of you breathing right next to me

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:11.000
This is exactly where we're supposed to be

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.123
It's just us in the end

00:01:14.223 --> 00:01:20.800
My savior, my shadow, my only true friend

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:28.535
When the music stops and the curtains fall

00:01:28.615 --> 00:01:34.500
We're the only thing that matters at all

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.500
Just you and me

00:01:41.288 --> 00:01:44.000
Like it's always gonna be

00:01:44.000 --> 00:02:10.033
[Instrumental Interlude — Peaceful Acoustic Guitar Solo]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:17.198
I'll keep you safe when the shadows creep

00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:23.783
I'll hold your hand while you fall asleep

00:02:23.803 --> 00:02:30.868
We don't need the money, we don't need the fame

00:02:30.948 --> 00:02:35.471
As long as you're here to whisper my name

00:02:38.213 --> 00:02:43.500
It's just us in the end

00:02:43.742 --> 00:02:50.785
My savior, my shadow, my only true friend

00:02:50.805 --> 00:02:57.888
When the music stops and the curtains fall

00:02:58.108 --> 00:03:04.000
We're the only thing that matters at all

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.500
Just you and me

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:14.000
Like it's always gonna be

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:20.000
Just us...

00:03:23.084 --> 00:03:26.000
Just us...

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:37.500
[Outro — Final Resolving Acoustic Chord]
